<title>SPAIN: Sevillana 1996 profit 20.41 bln ptas - press.</title>
<headline>Sevillana 1996 profit 20.41 bln ptas - press.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electricity firm Sevillana de Electricidad posted net profit of 20.41 billion pesetas in 1996, financial daily Cinco Dias reported on Monday.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Sevillana was not immediately able to confirm the figures, due for release later this week.</p>
<p>Pretax profit in 1996 was 25.22 billion pesetas, while operating income was 289.08 billion pesetas, Cinco Dias said.</p>
<p>In 1995 Sevillana posted net profit of 16.53 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
